# Project-specific risk paths (R11). Copy to .pandacorp/risk-paths.
# All examples are inactive. Inspect the project, propose exact globs to the owner,
# and activate only the confirmed paths. Never copy another project's paths blindly.
# One project-relative glob per line. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
# risk <glob> raises the zone to floor; low <glob> marks it classified without
# lowering any risk signal. A bare glob also means risk. No inline machine data.
#
# Authentication redirect handler: returnTo / callback URL validation can affect
# redirect safety even when the built-in classifier misses it (NOTA-1).
# risk src/app/api/auth/redirect/route.ts
# risk src/**/redirect-handler.*
#
# Other sensitive project boundaries, adapt to the real code layout:
# risk src/**/permissions/**
# risk src/**/billing/**
# risk src/**/data-export/**
# risk scripts/migrations/**
# low docs/**

